  "plain": "A podcast host, Jesse Michels, says that in July 1947 a flying disc came down near Roswell, New Mexico. According to Michels, the Roswell Army Airfield, the local military base, put out a press release saying it had a flying disc and then took the statement back in a panic. He tells it because the official announcement and its quick reversal would suggest something real was being hidden."
